ize:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}.langs{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto 0;font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted)}.langs a{color:var(--lapis)}</style>\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-ER9F5C2HC1\"></script>\n<script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments)}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-ER9F5C2HC1',{allow_google_signals:false,allow_ad_personalization_signals:false});</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/106.html\">Surah Quraish</a> › Verse 3</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Quraish 106:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَلْيَعْبُدُوا رَبَّ هَٰذَا الْبَيْتِ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">Let them worship the Lord of this House,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">لا يمنع أن يكون غير قريش مأمورين بعبادة رب هذا البيت، بل أمر الله جميع الثقلين: الجن والإنس أن يعبدوا رب هذا البيت.<cite>«الجواب الصحيح لمن بدل دين المسيح» 3/152</cite></blockquote></section><div class=\"muy\"><div class=\"muy-head\"><b>Al-Mukhtasar in Interpreting the Noble Qur&#x27;an</b><small>The overall meaning of the verse — not the words of the two shaykhs</small></div><p class=\"muy-text\">3. They should worship Allah alone, who is the Lord of this sacred house. He is the one who has made these journeys easy for them. They should not ascribe any partners to Him.</p><a class=\"muy-credit\" href=\"https://quranenc.com/en/browse/english_mokhtasar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation of Al-Mukhtasar in Interpreting the Noble Quran — 2026-11-04 · QuranEnc.com</a></div><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s106a3\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/en/ayah/106-4.html\">Next verse (106:4)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" aria-label=\"Language\">🌐 <a href=\"/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" data-l=\"ar\">العربية</a> · <b lang=\"en\">English</b> · <a href=\"/ur/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"ur\" lang=\"ur\" data-l=\"ur\">اردو</a> · <a href=\"/id/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"id\" lang=\"id\" data-l=\"id\">Bahasa Indonesia</a> · <a href=\"/tr/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\" data-l=\"tr\">Türkçe</a> · <a href=\"/fr/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\" data-l=\"fr\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/bn/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"bn\" lang=\"bn\" data-l=\"bn\">বাংলা</a> · <a href=\"/ms/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"ms\" lang=\"ms\" data-l=\"ms\">Bahasa Melayu</a> · <a href=\"/fa/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" data-l=\"fa\">فارسی</a> · <a href=\"/ru/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"ru\" lang=\"ru\" data-l=\"ru\">Русский</a> · <a href=\"/sw/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"sw\" lang=\"sw\" data-l=\"sw\">Kiswahili</a> · <a href=\"/ha/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"ha\" lang=\"ha\" data-l=\"ha\">Hausa</a> · <a href=\"/es/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\" data-l=\"es\">Español</a> · <a href=\"/de/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"de\" lang=\"de\" data-l=\"de\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/zh/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" data-l=\"zh\">中文</a> · <a href=\"/hi/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\" data-l=\"hi\">हिन्दी</a> · <a href=\"/ps/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"ps\" lang=\"ps\" data-l=\"ps\">پښتو</a> · <a href=\"/so/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"so\" lang=\"so\" data-l=\"so\">Soomaali</a> · <a href=\"/uz/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"uz\" lang=\"uz\" data-l=\"uz\">Ўзбекча</a> · <a href=\"/ku/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"ku\" lang=\"ku\" data-l=\"ku\">کوردی</a> · <a href=\"/az/ayah/106-3.html\" hreflang=\"az\" lang=\"a